    "summary": "HyperFrames static-frame-dedup opens a second verification page; after it closes the primary capture page loses its page.setViewport(1280x720) device-metrics override (window.innerHeight: 720 -> 633), while captureBeyondViewport had already been downgraded to false because the document scrollHeight fits 720. CDP then paints only 633 viewport rows; the remaining 87 rows are black.",
